        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PR-ATL03, Ornate Atlantic 3 Acrylic Door Pull with Brass Sleeve Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Acrylic Door Handle with Sleeve Back-to-Back Pair comes packaged with everything you need to install on a wood, metal, or glass door. Choose from 18-1/2 inch, 20-1/2 inch, or 24-1/2 inch lengths in either clear or frosted acrylic. The brass finials are 1 inch in diameter; and all the brass pieces are available in your choice of finish.  The Atlantic Series 3 Acrylic Door Handle Pair has an ornate look that makes it perfect for grand spaces, and since the acrylic is 1-1/2 inches thick, it will be able to hold up on even the largest doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with Back to Back mounting (2 door pulls bolted to each other - 1 door pull for each side of a door). Includes lock down threaded rosettes to securely tighten the door pulls to the door. \r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Individual <a href=\"/products/decorative-acrylic-door-handle-with-sleeve-first-impressions-atl03\"><b>First Impressions ATL03 Acrylic Door Pull</b></a> for one side of a door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Atlantic Collection Series 3 Large Decorative Acrylic Door Handle:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear or Frosted Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-ATL03-specifications.pdf?v=1704262247\"><b>First Impressions PR-ATL03 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>FII-PR-ATL03018:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 14-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Acrylic Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.32\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.67\"</li>\r\n<li>Finial Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-PR-ATL03020:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 20-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 16-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Acrylic Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.32\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.67\"</li>\r\n<li>Finial Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-PR-ATL03024:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 20-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Acrylic Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.32\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.67\"</li>\r\n<li>Finial Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Large Acrylic Door Handles, Pair",
                "description": "First Impressions PR-ATL03, Acrylic Door Handle with Sleeve Back-to-Back Pair - The Acrylic Door Handle with Sleeve Back-to-Back Pair comes packaged with everything you need to install on a wood, metal, or glass door. Choose from 18-1/2 inch, 20-1/2 inch, or 24-1/2 inch lengths in either clear or frosted acrylic. The brass finials are 1 inch in diameter; and all the brass pieces are available in your choice of finish.  The Atlantic Series 3 Acrylic Door Handle Pair has an ornate look that makes it perfect for grand spaces, and since the acrylic is 1-1/2 inches thick, it will be able to hold up on even the largest doors.\r\n",
